OL,3,GNEWSAHow one teenager's alpacas are
OL,4,Ahelping children with additional needs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who has autism and ADHD has
OL,7,Fhelped turn his alpaca farm into a safe
OL,8,Fhaven for other children with special
OL,9,Feducational needs.
OL,11,FHayden Geraghty, 16, and his mother
OL,12,FCaroline welcome children and adults to
OL,13,Ftheir farm in Limavady, County
OL,14,FLondonderry, for what is known as
OL,15,Falpaca therapy.
OL,17,FThe farm at the foot of Binevenagh
OL,18,Fmountain also has Valais Blacknose
OL,19,Fsheep, and Hayden regularly takes the
OL,20,Fanimals to visit his school.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
