OL,3,GNEWSAHow one teenager's alpacas are
OL,4,Ahelping children with additional needs
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth experts and charities have said
OL,7,Fworking with alpacas can be
OL,8,Ftherapeutic, reduce anxiety and improve
OL,9,Fsomeone's mental and emotional
OL,10,Fwell-being.
